      "versionNonce": 1089540208,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Timing rules\n\u2022 Every instruction: 1 engine cycle + delay field\n\u2022 Stalls only: WAIT, blocking PULL / PUSH\n\u2022 A stall has no side effects (formal proof)\n\u2022 Critical path to check in STA:\n   PC \u2192 imem mux \u2192 decode \u2192 next-PC",
      "originalText": "Timing rules\n\u2022 Every instruction: 1 engine cycle + delay field\n\u2022 Stalls only: WAIT, blocking PULL / PUSH\n\u2022 A stall has no side effects (formal proof)\n\u2022 Critical path to check in STA:\n   PC \u2192 imem mux \u2192 decode \u2192 next-PC",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "note-073",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
